95	    /**
96	     * Monotonically increasing sequence number stamped onto every {@code OWNER_CREATED} structured
97	     * event, so events can be totally ordered across creates. Shared across all creates for the life
98	     * of the application; a plain counter is enough since it only ever grows.
99	     */
